Third-party compiled components

This directory contains an unmodified compiled Codex App Node adapter and a derived
subset of compiled App resources produced by OpenAI and bundled third-party
components. Their existing copyrights, license
notices and applicable terms remain in effect. The MIT license in the repository
root covers project-authored source and does not apply to this directory.

No new license or additional permission for these upstream components is granted
by this repository. Notices retained in the adapter and generated kernel remain
applicable.

See ../../THIRD_PARTY.md for provenance and the component boundary.
